<title>FRANCE: AGF sold property assets for 850 mln ffr.</title>
<headline>AGF sold property assets for 850 mln ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurance group AGF said it had sold property assets for 850 million francs net in cash to MAAF Assurances.</p>
<p>The real estate involves 16 buildings of a total of 45,000 square metres of commercial and residential properties located in Paris between Etoile and Opera.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
